# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar
N You arrive on the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar. Walk west through the main gate into the Valley of Strength.
A 97246 | Thatog, in the Valley of Strength near the inn
F Orgrimmar | Flight master on top of the tower in the Valley of Strength
T 97246 | Borstan at his firepit in the Drag
A 97249 | He gives you Migi's lunch; you deliver it behind Grommash Hold a bit later
A 97242 @ Orgrimmar, 56.1, 34.4 | Kor'geld in Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions, north end of the Drag
C 97242 @ Orgrimmar, 69.0, 30.5 | Go east into the Valley of Honor and pick 2 Cattails and 4 Speargrass growing along the water
T 97242 @ Orgrimmar, 56.1, 34.4 | Back to Kor'geld
A 97275 | Yelmak, in the same shop
T 97275 | Whuut stands a few steps away in the shop
T 97249 | Migi plays with his friends behind Grommash Hold in the Valley of Wisdom
A 97326 | Thra, one of Migi's friends
C 97326 @ Orgrimmar, 42.5, 32.5 | Pick up 8 Smooth Boulders lying on the ground around the Valley of Wisdom
T 97326
A 5726 | Thrall, inside Grommash Hold
A 1061 @ Orgrimmar, 38.9, 38.4 | Zor Lonetree, outside Grommash Hold. This is for later (Stonetalon), just keep it
N Leave Orgrimmar by the main gate. Skull Rock is the rocky hill just east of the gate, north of the zeppelin tower.
C 5726 | Kill Burning Blade Fanatics and Apprentices in and around Skull Rock until a Lieutenant's Insignia drops
A 832 @ Durotar, 51.9, 9.6 | At the back of the Skull Rock cave, kill Gazz'uz (level 14 warlock with a voidwalker). Frost Nova the voidwalker and burst him down. His Eye of Burning Shadow starts this quest
T 5726 | Back into the city to Thrall
A 5727
C 5727 @ Orgrimmar, 49.5, 50.6 | Show the insignia to Neeru Fireblade in the Cleft of Shadow and go through his dialogue
T 832 @ Orgrimmar, 49.5, 50.6 | Neeru Fireblade, on the same visit
T 5727 | Back to Thrall. Do not take the next Hidden Enemies or Slaying the Beast: both are Ragefire Chasm quests

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the Crossroads
G The Barrens, 62.3, 19.4 | Leave by the main gate, follow the road south and take the western fork over the Southfury River bridge to Far Watch Post
N From Far Watch Post follow the road west, turn left (south) at the T-junction and stay on the road until the Crossroads.
S Crossroads | Innkeeper at the Crossroads inn
F Crossroads | Wind rider master on the tower in the Crossroads
T 1358 | Apothecary Helbrim
A 1492 | A crate for Ratchet; you deliver it later
A 848 | Also Helbrim. You pick the spores up at the Forgotten Pools
A 869 | Gazrog
A 844 | Sergra Darkthorn
A 870 | Tonga Runetotem
