# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Quilboars and plainstriders next to the Crossroads
C 871 | Razormane camp just north-east of the Crossroads: kill Water Seekers, Thornweavers and Hunters. Pull them one or two at a time and use Frost Nova to get distance
C 844 | Kill plainstriders all around the Crossroads for 7 Plainstrider Beaks. Any Sunscale raptor you meet also drops Raptor Heads
