A 903 | Prowlers are north, toward the Sludge Fen; you hunt them later in this segment
T 870
A 877
T 848 | Apothecary Helbrim. Decline his next quest, Apothecary Zamah: it is timed, and you take it from him right before the Thunder Bluff trip (segment 6)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South-east to Ratchet
