# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North: Thorn Hill, Sludge Fen, Boulder Lode Mine
C 821:1,821:2 @ The Barrens, 52.4, 26.7 | Around the Crossroads: Savannah Huntresses (lions) drop Savannah Lion Tusks and plainstriders drop Plainstrider Kidneys. Prowlers further north also drop tusks
C 872,5041 | Thorn Hill, north-east along the road: kill Razormane Geomancers and Defenders and Kreenig Snarlsnout on the hill. Pick up Crossroads' Supply Crates lying around the hill
C 869,903 @ The Barrens, 55.5, 14.5 | North along the road towards the Sludge Fen: Sunscale Screechers drop Raptor Heads, Savannah Prowlers drop Prowler Claws
T 894 | The Venture Co. research site in the Sludge Fen: use the Control Console
A 900
C 900 | Shut off the three valves on the pipes around the console
