# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South: Lushwater Oasis and Mankrik's wife
C 880 @ The Barrens, 46.8, 39.6 | Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads: kill Oasis Snapjaws for 8 Altered Snapjaw Shells. Kolkar Stormers here drop bracers too
C 4921 | Follow the Gold Road south: Mankrik's wife lies at a burned-out camp near the road, among the quilboars
C 821:3 @ The Barrens, 47.0, 51.0 | Kill Stormsnouts (thunder lizards, level 18-19) around the body until a Thunder Lizard Horn drops. Pull one at a time, Frost Nova and kite it. If you cannot kill one, abandon Chen's Empty Keg now: no later step hands it in
T 4921 | Back to Mankrik. He may then offer Her Name Is Olgra (new in Forever, Razormane Raiders around his wife's body): leave it for now; you take it from him in segment 6, after its first loop
T 880 | Tonga Runetotem, next to Mankrik
A 3301 | Tonga. A delivery to Mura Runetotem at the Sepulcher; keep it in your log, the route hands it in at the start of segment 7

